  contentsAnswer: Several books, a camera and a spare shirt.
  weightAnswer: Around nine kilos. The books are most of it.
  metalAnswer: An old metal-bodied camera, wrapped between the books.
  packingAnswer: Tightly packed; nothing should roll.
  responseAnswer: No battery motor or loose mechanism. A small dull impact is possible.
  authorReasoning: 9.2 kg and modest metal response fit a metal camera among heavier
    books; fixed balanced load.
